OL,3,GNEWSAGold believed to date from Bronze
OL,4,AAge found in dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FA metal detectorist found a gold ingot
OL,7,Fin a field in Leicestershire which
OL,8,Fcould date back to the Bronze Age.
OL,10,FSteve McKnight - who has been scanning
OL,11,Ffor objects in the ground for about 12
OL,12,Fyears - was taking part in an organised
OL,13,Fdig on 14 September 2025 in Market
OL,14,FBosworth when he struck gold.
OL,16,FThe 66-year-old told the BBC it was
OL,17,F"great" to get the ingot out of the
OL,18,Fground - with an inquest on Tuesday
OL,19,Fhearing the object could date back
OL,20,Fthousands of years.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
