OL,3,GNEWSAGold believed to date from Bronze
OL,4,AAge found in dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the item was more than 300 years old
OL,7,Fand at least 10% precious metal, it was
OL,8,Fdeemed to meet the requirements of the
OL,9,FTreasure Act 1996.
